{"version":1,"content":"<p>德國軍方已停飛國防科技初創企業Quantum Systems生產的無人機。此前，該公司遭到網絡攻擊，成為歐洲軍工行業遭受惡意行為者攻擊的最新案例。兩名知情人士透露，在總部位於巴伐利亞州的Quantum Systems遭遇網絡攻擊後，德國聯邦國防軍出於預防考慮採取了這一措施。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586264.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.751238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:06:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888421+00:00","content_hash":"770043a18665e911a61d5433bd2e81aa01f158bc13181ff304a18b9a7097251b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}